54	 * It's strongly recommended to not put the same DBSObject in tree model multiple times.
55	 * It will work but some actions will not work well
56	 * (e.g. TreeViewer sometimes update only first TreeItem corresponding to model certain model object).
57	 */
58	public class DBNModel {
